# The carpet ride's setting of its cruising speed across ($81:E503): the
# ride whose record has $06 = 1 would get speed $0300 ($81:E508), but the
# routine is called only from the other ride's branch ($81:E4EC), so the
# retail game never runs it. A unit call with the player's $06 = 1.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
set $0008E1 01
call 81E503 d=08DB db=80 p=30
